# Jurati, Cordial Queen triggers for "artifact creatures" (CR 603.2): Grizzly Bears are no artifact, so their combat damage
# to Bot2 on turn 3 goes unanswered even with a Clue waiting to be copied. No trigger goes off: no target is asked and the
# Clue count stays at one.

